      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Changed

- **The real OpenOats logo, everywhere.** The menu panel, welcome screen and empty Meetings view now show the app icon's mark: two concentric rings on a black tile.
- **New menu bar icon.** It's the same two rings. While recording, the inner ring fills in to a dot, so you can tell at a glance that OpenOats is recording.

No changes to recording, transcription or your Meeting files.
]]></description>
